<h1>Brad Stephens</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 20th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Republican. Incumbent.</p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Has not published a platform for this race that we could find; he is unopposed. Bills he has sponsored, as listed on ilga.gov, cover transportation, property taxation, insurance regulation, public safety and municipal governance.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Mayor of Rosemont since 2007, previously a Rosemont village trustee (1989-2007) and Leyden Township supervisor, and a former member of the Illinois Tollway and Pace boards; in the House since June 2019, where he is an Assistant Minority Leader.</p>
